---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import ExploreMethods from '../components/ExploreMethods.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Simple Senior Fitness - Our Mission"
  description="Learn about Simple Senior Fitness, the personal story behind the site, and the Japanese practitioners and traditions we credit for the techniques we share."
  keywords="about us, Simple Senior Fitness, Japanese wellness practices, traditional Japanese medicine, wellness mission"
  canonicalUrl="https://simpleseniorfitness.com/about"
  author="Simple Senior Fitness"
>
  <main class="flex-1 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto pb-12 px-6">
    <section class="pt-10 pb-8 max-w-4xl">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-accent-dark text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 border border-emerald-200">About Us</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-[1.2rem] lg:text-[2rem] font-medium leading-tight text-text-main-light mb-6">
        Bringing Ancient Wisdom to Modern Wellness
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-muted-light">
        Discover how Simple Senior Fitness is bridging traditional Japanese wellness practices with contemporary health needs.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
      <article class="article-text lg:col-span-8 space-y-8">

        <!-- Our Story -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="our-story">
          My Story
        </h2>
        <p class="drop-cap text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          Like many people over 50, I found myself struggling with chronic back and neck pain. As a developer spending countless hours at a desk, the pain had become my constant companion. Traditional treatments provided only temporary relief, and I knew there had to be a better way.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          That's when I discovered traditional Japanese wellness practices. Simple techniques like the towel stretches developed by practitioners like Dr. Toshiki Fukutsudzi and other Japanese physical therapy methods changed my life. These gentle, consistent movements didn't just mask the pain. They addressed the root causes.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          Simple Senior Fitness was born from this personal transformation. I'm not a medical professional. I'm someone who found real relief through these time-tested techniques and wants to share them with others who are suffering like I was. Everything I share is based on established Japanese wellness practices, backed by research, and properly attributed to the experts who developed these methods.
        </p>

        <!-- Our Mission -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="our-mission">
          My Mission
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          I believe that wellness shouldn't be complicated or expensive. My mission is to share the traditional Japanese wellness practices that helped me, making them accessible and understandable for others facing similar challenges. Through carefully researched content that properly credits the experts and practitioners who developed these techniques, I aim to help people:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 my-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="deco-icon flex-shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-accent-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span class="text-xl text-text-main-light">Relieve chronic pain through gentle, sustainable practices</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="deco-icon flex-shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-accent-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span class="text-xl text-text-main-light">Improve flexibility and mobility at any age</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="deco-icon flex-shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-accent-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span class="text-xl text-text-main-light">Build sustainable wellness habits rooted in centuries of wisdom</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="deco-icon flex-shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-accent-dark text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-1" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            <span class="text-xl text-text-main-light">Prevent future health issues through preventative care</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Our Approach -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="our-approach">
          Our Approach
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          What sets Simple Senior Fitness apart is our commitment to authenticity combined with scientific validation. Every technique we share is:
        </p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8">
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-dark text-3xl">verified</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-text-main-light">Traditionally Rooted</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">Based on authentic Japanese wellness practices passed down through generations of practitioners.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-dark text-3xl">science</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-text-main-light">Evidence-Based</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">Supported by modern research and validated through clinical studies and peer-reviewed literature.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-dark text-3xl">accessibility</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-text-main-light">Accessible</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">Designed for people of all fitness levels and ages, requiring minimal or no equipment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-accent-dark text-3xl">clear_day</span>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-text-main-light">Practical</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">Easy to integrate into daily routines with clear, step-by-step instructions you can follow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- About Me -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="about-me">
          About Me
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal mb-8">
          I'm a developer in my 50s who discovered the power of traditional Japanese wellness practices through personal necessity. After years of struggling with back pain, these gentle techniques gave me my life back.
        </p>

        <!-- Personal Bio Card -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-200 mb-6">
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-2xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light mb-2">Who I Am</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-accent-dark uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Developer & Wellness Advocate</p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              I'm not a doctor or certified physical therapist. I'm a regular person who spent years battling chronic back and neck pain from desk work. When I discovered Japanese wellness practices in my 50s, everything changed.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
              This site shares the techniques that worked for me, always with proper attribution to the Japanese practitioners and researchers who developed them, like Dr. Toshiki Fukutsudzi's towel method, and the traditional practices of Sotai and Makko-Ho.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light leading-relaxed">
              <strong class="text-text-main-light">Important:</strong> I share these practices based on my personal experience and research, but I always recommend consulting with qualified healthcare professionals before starting any new exercise routine, especially if you have existing health conditions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- My Values -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="my-values">
          My Principles
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
          <div class="border-l-4 border-accent-dark pl-6 py-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-text-main-light mb-2">Honesty</h3>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">I share what worked for me personally, always with proper attribution to the experts who developed these techniques.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-accent-dark pl-6 py-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-text-main-light mb-2">Transparency</h3>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">I'm clear about my limitations. I'm not a medical professional, just someone sharing their journey and research.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-accent-dark pl-6 py-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-text-main-light mb-2">Research-Based</h3>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">Every technique I share comes from established Japanese practices with proper citations and references.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-l-4 border-accent-dark pl-6 py-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-text-main-light mb-2">Safety First</h3>
            <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light">I always recommend consulting healthcare professionals and never claim to replace medical advice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- What You Can Expect -->
        <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-3xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light pt-4" id="what-to-expect">
          What You Can Expect From This Site
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-main-light font-normal">
          I'm committed to providing honest, well-researched information about traditional Japanese wellness practices. Here's what you'll find:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 ml-6">
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>Personal experiences with Japanese wellness techniques that helped my chronic pain</li>
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>Properly attributed information from established Japanese practitioners and researchers</li>
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>References to peer-reviewed research supporting these traditional practices</li>
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>Clear disclaimers that this is educational content, not medical advice</li>
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>Honest acknowledgment that I'm a regular person sharing what worked for me</li>
          <li class="text-lg text-text-main-light"><span class="deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦ </span>Recommendations to consult qualified healthcare professionals for medical concerns</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Disclaimer -->
        <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mt-8 border border-amber-200">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-600 text-3xl flex-shrink-0">warning</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-xl text-text-main-light mb-3">Medical Disclaimer</h3>
              <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light leading-relaxed mb-3">
                The information on this website is for educational purposes only and based on my personal experience with traditional Japanese wellness practices. I am not a licensed medical professional, physical therapist, or healthcare provider.
              </p>
              <p class="text-base text-text-muted-light leading-relaxed">
                <strong>Always consult with qualified healthcare professionals before starting any new exercise or wellness routine, especially if you have pre-existing medical conditions, chronic pain, or injuries.</strong> The techniques shared here are based on established Japanese practices and research, but individual results may vary.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mt-12 border border-emerald-200">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[1.5rem] font-medium lg:text-2xl lg:font-medium text-text-main-light mb-4">Explore Japanese Wellness Practices</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-text-main-light mb-6">
            Discover the traditional techniques that helped me overcome chronic back pain and improve my quality of life.
          </p>
          <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent-dark hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors shadow-md hover:shadow-lg">
            Read My Articles
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>

      </article>

      <Sidebar tocItems={[
        { href: "#our-story", text: "Our Story" },
        { href: "#our-mission", text: "Our Mission" },
        { href: "#our-approach", text: "Our Approach" },
        { href: "#about-me", text: "About Me" },
        { href: "#my-values", text: "My Values" },
        { href: "#what-to-expect", text: "What to Expect" },
      ]} />
    </div>

    <ExploreMethods />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
